  "description": "Located just 500 metres from the Swan River and a little over 1km from the vibrant Maylands café strip, this renovated two-bedroom apartment offers an unbeatable inner-city lifestyle in one of Perth's most desirable riverside suburbs.<br/><br/>Set within a secure, well-maintained complex, the apartment features a large balcony, secure parking, and access to a fully maintained swimming pool-perfect for cooling off during summer. With riverside walkways, cycling paths and parklands only moments away via Milmoe Lane, this home is ideal for those who love an active, outdoor lifestyle.<br/><br/>You'll enjoy exceptional connectivity with:<br/><br/>1.1km to Maylands Café Strip<br/>2.5km to Mount Lawley Café Strip<br/>4km to Claisebrook Inlet restaurants<br/>5.5km to Optus Stadium<br/>Approx. 5km to Perth CBD<br/><br/>Whether you're commuting, dining out, or enjoying the outdoors, everything is right at your doorstep.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/><br/>2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom<br/>Private balcony<br/>Apartment area: 54.6sqm (Strata Plan)<br/>Partly renovated kitchen and bathroom/laundry<br/>Secure complex with lock-and-key foyer access<br/>Secure undercover and open-air parking with automatic gates<br/>Fully maintained in-ground swimming pool<br/>Approx. 15-minute walk to train station and cafés<br/><br/>This well-located, renovated apartment offers outstanding value and a lifestyle that's hard to beat in Maylands.<br/><br/>-<br/><br/>Register your interest and secure a viewing by visiting Carlin Team website: carlinteam.com.au<br/><br/>It is essential you register so that we can keep you informed of any changes.<br/><br/>Looking for a property manager? If you interested in discussing our property management services, we would love to hear from you. Please contact our office on 08 9494 3444 or success@carlinteam.com.au.<br/><br/>Information Disclaimer: This document has been prepared for advertising and marketing purposes only. It is believed to be reliable and accurate, but clients must make their own independent enquiries and rely on their own personal judgement about the information included. Carlin Team Real Estate and its employees accepts no responsibility for the results of any actions taken, or reliance placed upon this document by a client.",
